A lock () or https:// means you’ve safely connected to the .gov website. Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites. To understand how atomic clocks work as sensors, we need to know a bit about Einstein’s theory of general relativity. Relativity tells us that time ticks more slowly in stronger gravity. Here on Earth, for example, a clock ticks", "display_url": "nist.gov/quantum-inform…", "end": 119, "expanded_url": "https://www.nist.gov/quantum-information-science/atomic-clocks-exquisite-sensors-more-just-time", "images": [{"height": 1120, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119908189390901248/Spm5UysC?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2400}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119908189390901248/Spm5UysC?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 96, "status": 200, "title": "Atomic Clocks: Exquisite Sensors for More Than Just Time", "unwound_url": "https://www.nist.gov/quantum-information-science/quantum-sensing-explained/atomic-clocks-exquisite-sensors-more-just-time", "url": "https://t.co/gNrJmbNKQn"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Hi5TTvemN6", "end": 143, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2119908141554909334/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119908139268980736", "start": 120, "url": "https://t.co/Hi5TTvemN6"}]}, "id": "2119908141554909334", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2724, "like_count": 46, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "When is a clock more than a way to tell time? When it’s used as a quantum sensor! \n\nLearn more: https://t.co/gNrJmbNKQn https://t.co/Hi5TTvemN6", "url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2119908141554909334"}, {"author_id": "6374602", "created_at": "2026-11-09T20:37:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119892213022982417"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "General statements are information shared with the public that was not addressed by an official press release. All issued press releases are posted separately on our Press Release page.Statements related to General Aviation incidents may be found on our Accidents and Incidents page.News media with questions on other topics may contact us at pressoffice@faa.gov.", "display_url": "faa.gov/newsroom/state…", "end": 221, "expanded_url": "https://www.faa.gov/newsroom/statements/general-statements", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117358869383172096/z8kcucfY?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117358869383172096/z8kcucfY?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 198, "status": 200, "title": "FAA General Statements", "unwound_url": "https://www.faa.gov/newsroom/statements/general-statements", "url": "https://t.co/O9u0tDRVmX"}]}, "id": "2119892213022982417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 18087, "like_count": 214, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 25}, "text": "The FAA noted in a brief statement today about issuing a reentry license for Sierra Space's Dream Chaser that it is doing so \"well in advance of Sierra Space’s targeted spring 2027 mission date.\" \n\nhttps://t.co/O9u0tDRVmX", "url": "https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2119892213022982417"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T19:36:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119876752071692398"], "id": "2119876752071692398", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 8469, "like_count": 277, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "My overwhelming takeaway from the Douthat-Trump interview is that Trump is definitely not senile, and in fact very much still himself.\n\nAnd I found his \"could you forgive your enemies\" answer actually rather refreshing. Sad. But refreshing in its self-awareness.", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119876752071692398"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T18:57:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119867099124469890"], "entities"